  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03XR">Lemma <span data-tag="03XR">67.28.3</span>.</a> A base change of a morphism of finite presentation is of finite presentation. The same holds for locally of finite presentation. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
